{"2421080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Synth Beasts", "steam_appid": 2421080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421080/extras/456e13d38634ad6b5a6667e68e3aa56c.poster.avif?t=1769444774\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421080/extras/456e13d38634ad6b5a6667e68e3aa56c.webm?t=1769444774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421080/extras/456e13d38634ad6b5a6667e68e3aa56c.mp4?t=1769444774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture monsters to use them against the scientists who created you. Sail the open ocean in a stolen boat belonging to your captors, and destroy their failed experimental creatures to put an end to the creation of the Synth Beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Collecting:</strong> Capture over 40 Synth Beasts. Level them up to improve their stats and develop new abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Sea:</strong> Navigate the ocean in your stolen boat and explore dozens of islands inhabited by failed experiments—the Synth Beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vengeance:</strong> Your choices shape your ending—seek revenge or spare the scientists who created you to unlock different endings.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421080/extras/456e13d38634ad6b5a6667e68e3aa56c.poster.avif?t=1769444774\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic